jobs.description:
Wat je gaat doen - Work on the production line: cutting, lifting, packing, and packaging cheese products efficiently and accurately;
- Maintain a clean workspace: follow hygiene and safety protocols to ensure a safe and organized working environment;
- Collaborate with colleagues: communicate effectively within a diverse team to keep production running smoothly;
- Work in shifts: commit to a minimum of 24 hours per week, including evening and night shifts, with flexibility in scheduling;
- Invest in your growth: participate in internal training programs and explore opportunities for career advancement, such as becoming a bandleider or transitioning to other roles.

   Wat we je bieden - A salary of €16.31 per hour;
- Evening and night shift allowances of 130% (6:00 PM – 10:00 PM) and 140% (10:00 PM – 7:00 AM);
- Temporary contract with the possibility of a permanent position;
- Flexible hours: work between 24 and 36 hours per week;
- 8% holiday allowance and 24 vacation days;
- Travel allowance from 10 km, up to €8.32 per day;
- Internal training and career advancement opportunities, such as becoming a team leader or operator.

At Start People, we operate on the principle of equal pay; your terms and conditions of employment always match those of colleagues who are employed directly by the client. This means that, in addition to your hourly rate, your terms and conditions of employment also include, for example, the number of days off, allowances, time-off-in-lieu payments and other pay components.
   Functie-eisen We are looking for a motivated and flexible team player who thrives in a dynamic production environment and is eager to contribute to our high-quality cheese packaging process.
